0..76 Comment "//! A definition whose selected arm is another definition\'s call, stuck at a"
77..153 Comment "//! variable: `viaZero(Zero, h)` selects `emp(h)`, which cases on `h` and so"
154..230 Comment "//! runs no further. The call converts with the call its arm reached, at any"
231..309 Comment "//! depth of such arms, and the kernel replays each step. A family computed by"
310..388 Comment "//! recursion on its index is unfolded only as far as the index\'s constructors"
389..434 Comment "//! take it [Dybjer-1994-inductive_families]."
435..438 Comment "//!"
439..455 Comment "//! - see: #2832"
456..501 Comment "//! - cites: [Dybjer-1994-inductive_families]"
502..505 Comment "//!"
506..607 Comment "//! [Dybjer-1994-inductive_families]: https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01211308 \"Dybjer, Inductive families\""
609..645 Comment "// The naturals that select the arm."
